@base <https://ontoboard.org/patterns/nfdi-persistent-identifier.owl> .

<https://ontoboard.org/patterns/nfdi-persistent-identifier.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                                 dcterms:description "A persistent identifier (nfdi:NFDI_0001037, digital object identifier) is a first-class individual that is part-of the object it identifies via obo:BFO_0000050 and carries its resolvable address through nfdi:NFDI_0001008 (has url). The identifier is therefore describable in its own right rather than being a literal on the dataset."^^xsd:string ;
                                                                 dcterms:license <https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT> ;
                                                                 dcterms:title "fdos"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                 rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x7; term declared x3;
- header: dcterms:title \"fdos\" - the library's name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library's description of the pattern
- header: dcterms:license <https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT> - https://github.com/ISE-FIZKarlsruhe/matwerk
Each change is listed under \"curated\" in the pattern's metadata.json in OntoBoard's pattern library."""@en .

